eeded and tunjiro  can't help but think  how kind this was of her they continue  to talk about how they are doing  and both delight in kaburamaru the snake  that kano inherited from iguro the snake  pillar although kano definitely lost  some vision  in her remaining eye by using vermilion  eye to save tanjiro  she does explain that she still has some  vision left  although they part ways and tanjo is  having dinner with zenitsu nezuko and  inosuke at the end of this chapter  the next chapter pretty much reveals who  got together with whom  chapter 205 is a huge time skip where we  first meet the descendants of kano and  tanjiro namely kanata kamado  who looks very similar to kano and  sumihiko kamado who looks very similar  to  tanjiro i have no doubt the name kanata  itself is a reference to kano's name  just as aoba is a reference to aoi  suggesting that aoi got together with  inosuke and at this point some fans  suggested that the ships still weren't  official because descendants of these  characters  might have gone together rather than the  main characters themselves  immediately i was like no way to this  possibility  and the mangaka clearly had my back and  was kind enough to create an extended  ending where it was confirmed that  tundra  and kanel did get together and were  kanata and sumihiko's great great  grandparents  in this extended ending we also saw  flashbacks of tundra and kanel getting  closer  being nice to some crows together and  being wrapped around together by their  pet snake kaburamaru who was probably a  good wingman for tanjiro  and in the final panel tanjiro is  holding nezuko's hand with his left hand  and kano's hand with his right which is  perfect i love to see them together in  the final panel of the series  by the way if you are confused and  haven't seen this extended new ending i  will leave a link to the video i made  about it in the description of this  video  so there we have it the relationship  between tanjiro and kanel  fully explained although it didn't seem  super promising at the start when kanel  knocked him out and tried to kill his  sister they got over that hurdle  with a little help from tundra's amnesia  since he hilariously enough didn't even  remember she did that  after tundra flipped that coin at the  butterfly estate there was arguably no  going back and their ship kept getting  more and more perfect from there  they were both willing to risk their  lives for one another and were both  saved by one another on multiple  occasions and in multiple ways  i truly love this couple and after her  terrible upbringing i'm so glad  kanel got with someone she deserves  someone as  kind as tanjiro it truly warms my heart  every time i think of this  perfect ship but let me know your  thoughts on this couple  and if it's your favorite in  demonstrator or if you prefer another  one in the series  if you did enjoy this video show  demonstrator some love by smashing that  like button until it's blue  especially if you want to see similar  videos for zenitsu and nezuko  inosuke and aoi and so on if you haven't  make this the video you subscribe and  hit that notification bell to turn on  all notifications  or you will miss future demons player  videos and while you wait for your  suggestion to be made  feel free to check out my growing  demonstrator playlist which includes  videos on all the hashira  all demon moons and much more link to  that is in the description  and i especially want to thank the  patron squad over on patreon and here on  youtube who help make videos like this  one possible  first and foremost i want to thank the  patron of legend the one acknowledged by  lord twigo himself  alpha sigma and are the one to your  patrons the ones who stand atop  all clans ingrata pate heffa al-jatal dr  corbin the toaster chi  emperor taku spidey life tinel tungsten  tarkis baked buddhist cody hebert  and monkey d quilly and our pro hero  tier patrons  the one and only gilgamesh the re