-changing  scene was in the very first season  by the way because of the nature of this  video i won't be focusing too much on  kano's backstory  although i do go into it more in my how  strong is kanel video link in the  description long story short though she  had a very difficult upbringing  she grew up in poverty and in an abusive  home  she witnessed siblings pass away and if  she cried  she would get punished not surprisingly  she eventually broke psychologically and  was sold into slavery before  kanae and shinobu saved her although  they physically rescued her she was like  an  empty shell and kane had to give her a  coin to flip before she could even make  any decision  thus tundra straight up mends her broken  psyche here and although she will still  grow as a character from here  the wheels are clearly turning again  making tanjiro already one of the most  important figures in her life up to this  point  now we fast forward to tundra waking up  from his  coma after the fight against upper moons  gyutaro and daki who's the first person  he sees  none other than a concerned canal who  straight up drops and breaks a vase when  she sees he's up  she's no longer the empty shell she once  was she reveals that he's been  unconscious for two months  clearly she's been looking after him and  then she gives us one of the most  heartwarming  smiles with what appeared to be tears  coming from her  eyes and she tells tenjo that she's glad  he's awake  full ship ahead it's a moment that's  easy to gloss over  if you're waiting to get to the fight  but it shows  just how much kanao has come to care  about tanjiro the fact that she's the  first to see him suggest that she  in all likelihood spent the most time by  his bed now let's skip over to kano's  fight against upper moon 2  doma the whole fight is amazing but i'll  try to focus on the details that stand  out from a tundra  and kanel perspective the first thing  i'll mention and go back to is how kanel  like tanjiro the chosen one  is an amazing fighter in her own right  making them quite the power couple  doma says that kanao might just be a  little more skillful than shinobu who  he's just eaten  and that's before kannau even shows him  her full power  this is an important fight for kanau  because she is avenging both kane  and shinobu both of who rescued her from  slavery  and died at the hands of doma by this  point kano is definitely not  a vacant shell she is burning with  passion and specifically with hatred for  doma inosuke helps kano in this fight as  does shinobu who poisoned doma when he  ate her but kano is still amazing in it  she uses one of my favorite breath style  techniques ever  called the flower breathing final form  vermilion eye  which is pretty much like a shotting gun  with its own unique spin  it makes surrounding movements look dull  and slow and it causes pressure on the  eyes and that pressure stains them red  kano uses this ability and with the help  of inosuke and shinobu's poison  succeeds in defeating doma finally  carrying out her revenge  as a result of using this op technique  though she loses vision in her right  eye after the battle we find out that  kanel  couldn't cry for kanai after she died  but everyone was kind and didn't think  less of her because she couldn't show  emotion  and finally she cries harder than ever  the floodgates  open symbolizing that with her defeat of  doma  she's fully regained her ability to show  her emotions  similarly tundra completes his revenge  arc by finally beating muzon  with the help of everyone else and like  kano he loses vision in his right eye in  the process  and although it's sad that they both  lose vision in one eye it's yet another  thing  that for us hardcore romantics makes  them perfect for each other  and makes it seem like they're fated to  be together but let's not gloss over  this final battle because there are  quite a few  important moments concerning kano and  tanjuro there is a point where muzon has  taken out  almost everyone including the strongest  pillar and kano looks like the only  fighter left  he approaches her and is about to finish  her off and tundra swoops in with the  save using the legendary dance of the  fire god style and takes kanel away to  safety  at this point half of tundra's face is  mutated but he doesn't seem to care  he just apologizes to kanel for being  late and tells the kakushi to take care  of her  it's a complete 180 from the time kano  easily knocked him out with a kick and  you'd love to see it  however it's not just tundra doing the  saving kano's turn comes up  when tundra becomes an overpowered demon  kano still had some anti-demon medicine  and when she sees the state tundra is in  she realizes that this  is the reason she still has one eye left  kanel bless her heart  uses vermilion eye with her one  remaining eye in order to save tanjiro  she gets hurt in addition to hurting her  last remaining eye with her special  technique but it doesn't bother her as  she says  all she wishes for is for tanjiro to  come back to them  and you can noticeably see that her  words reach him  just as tundra saved kano kano was  willing to risk not just her vision but  her entire life  to save tanjiro as well and this effort  of kano  along with the words she speaks as well  as the medicine she gives tanjiro is the  big push which helps him return to the  world of humans as tundra recovers  kano is laying there in the distance as  well being treated for her injuries  they're both immobile laying on the  ground and they make eye contact and  both smile  and cry having just saved each other it  is such  a beautiful moment then during chapter  204 the second last chapter tundra and  kano share a great moment  after they've recovered to an extent  from their injuries they talk about how  the first user of flower breathing  planted the sakura tree in front of them  and named it victory kano wanted to tell  the tree that they succeeded and tunjiro  can't help but think  how kind this was of her they continue  to talk about how they are doing  and both delight in kaburamaru the snake  that kano inherited from iguro the snake  pillar although kano definitely lost  some vision  in her remaining eye by using vermilion  eye to save tanjiro  she does explain that she still has some  vision left  although they part ways and tanjo is  having dinner with zenitsu nezuko and  inosuke at the end of this chapter  the next chapter pretty much reveals who  got together with whom  chapter 205 is a huge time skip where we  first meet the descendants of kano and  tanjiro namely kanata kamado  who looks very similar to kano and  sumihiko kamado who looks very similar  to  tanjiro i have no doubt the name kanata  itself is a reference to kano's name  just as aoba is a reference to aoi  suggesting that aoi got together with  inosuke and at this point some fans  suggested that the ships still weren't  official because descendants of these  characters  might have gone together rather than the  main characters themselves  immediately i was like no way to this  possibility  and the mangaka clearly had my back and  was kind enough to create an extended  ending where it was confirmed that  tundra  and kanel did get together and were  kanata and sumihiko's great great  grandparents  in this extended ending we also saw  flashbacks of tundra and kanel getting  closer  being nice to some crows together and  being wrapped around together by their  pet snake kaburamaru who was probably a  good wingman for tanjiro  and in the final panel tanjiro is  holding nezuko's hand with his left hand  and kano's hand with his right which is  perfect i love to see them together in  the final panel of the series  by the way if you are confused and  haven't seen this extended new ending i  will leave a link to the video i made  about it in the description of this  video  so there we have it the relationship  between tanjiro and kanel  fully explained although it didn't seem  super promising at the start when kanel  knocked him out and tried to kill his  sister they got over that hurdle  with a little help from tundra's amnesia  since he hilariously enough didn't even  remember she did that  after tundra flipped that coin at the  butterfly estate there was arguably no  going back and their ship kept getting  more and more perfect from there  they were both willing to risk their  lives for one another and were both  saved by one another on multiple  occasions and in multiple ways  i truly love this couple and after her  terrible upbringing i'm so glad  kanel got with someone she deserves  someone as  kind as tanjiro it truly warms my heart  every time i think of this  perfect ship but let me know your  thoughts on this couple  and if it's your favorite in  demonstrator or if you prefer another  one in the series  if you did enjoy this video show  demonstrator some love by smashing that  like button until it's blue  especially if you want to see similar  videos for zenitsu and nezuko  inosuke and aoi and so on if you haven't  make this the video you subscribe and  hit that notification bell to turn on  all notifications  or you will miss future demons player  videos and while you wait for your  suggestion to be made  feel free to check out my growing  demonstrator playlist which includes  videos on all the hashira  all demon moons and much more link to  that is in the description  and i especially want to thank the  patron squad over on patreon and here on  youtube who help make videos like this  one possible  first and foremost i want to thank the  patron of legend the one acknowledged by  lord twigo himself  alpha sigma and are the one to your  patrons the ones who stand atop  all clans ingrata pate heffa al-jatal dr  corbin the toaster chi  emperor taku spidey life tinel tungsten  tarkis baked buddhist cody hebert  and monkey d quilly and our pro hero  tier patrons  the one and only gilgamesh the re